 "title": "拦在每一步",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 100.62,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "这些骗局有一个共同点。",
   "spoken": "这些骗局有一个共同点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.808,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.567
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "攻击者控制不了你的私钥，也控制不了链上合约的逻辑。",
   "spoken": "攻击者控制不了你的私钥，也控制不了链上合约的逻辑。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.628,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "speechStart": 4.726,
   "speechEnd": 8.321
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "每一步都要你的一个动作，点击、签名、复制、粘贴。",
   "spoken": "每一步都要你的一个动作，点击、签名、复制、粘贴。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-02.mp3",
   "start": 9.384,
   "dur": 5.88,
   "speechStart": 9.482,
   "speechEnd": 14.434
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "每一个动作，都是一个可以拦截的点。",
   "spoken": "每一个动作，都是一个可以拦截的点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-03.mp3",
   "start": 15.484,
   "dur": 3.312,
   "speechStart": 15.582,
   "speechEnd": 17.974
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "钱包这一层，先把签名请求解码成看得懂的字段。",
   "spoken": "钱包这一层，先把签名请求解码成看得懂的字段。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-04.mp3",
   "start": 19.016,
   "dur": 4.488,
   "speechStart": 19.114,
   "speechEnd": 22.649
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "授权给谁，额度多少，期限到哪天，委托哪个合约。",
   "spoken": "授权给谁，额度多少，期限到哪天，委托哪个合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-05.mp3",
   "start": 23.724,
   "dur": 5.424,
   "speechStart": 23.822,
   "speechEnd": 28.298
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "无法解码，就明确显示无法解析。",
   "spoken": "无法解码，就明确显示无法解析。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-06.mp3",
   "start": 29.368,
   "dur": 3.96,
   "speechStart": 29.466,
   "speechEnd": 32.477
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "无限授权、批量授权、7702 委托，默认强警告。",
   "spoken": "无限授权、批亮授权、7702 委托，默认强警告。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-07.mp3",
   "start": 33.548,
   "dur": 5.976,
   "speechStart": 33.646,
   "speechEnd": 38.693
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "7702 委托，只允许指向钱包自己审计过的实现合约，拒绝网站发起的委托请求。",
   "spoken": "7702 委托，只允许指向钱包自己审计过的实现合约，拒绝网站发起的委托请求。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-08.mp3",
   "start": 39.744,
   "dur": 7.872,
   "speechStart": 39.842,
   "speechEnd": 46.782
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "交易模拟，在签名之前，显示签完以后余额怎么变。",
   "spoken": "交易模拟，在签名之前，显示签完以后余额怎么变。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-09.mp3",
   "start": 47.836,
   "dur": 5.232,
   "speechStart": 47.934,
   "speechEnd": 52.243
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "新注册的域名、仿冒的域名，直接拦下。",
   "spoken": "新注册的域名、仿冒的域名，直接拦下。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-10.mp3",
   "start": 53.288,
   "dur": 4.272,
   "speechStart": 53.386,
   "speechEnd": 56.719
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "DApp 只请求精确额度的授权，用完就停。",
   "spoken": "DApp 只请求精确额度的授权，用完就停。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-11.mp3",
   "start": 57.78,
   "dur": 4.488,
   "speechStart": 57.878,
   "speechEnd": 61.449
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "交易所这一层，提币地址用白名单，新地址有冷却期。",
   "spoken": "交易所这一层，提币地址用白名单，新地址有冷却期。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-12.mp3",
   "start": 62.488,
   "dur": 5.472,
   "speechStart": 62.586,
   "speechEnd": 67.109
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "新地址和历史地址首尾相同、中间不同，就强提示。",
   "spoken": "新地址和历史地址首尾相同、中间不同，就强提示。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-13.mp3",
   "start": 68.18,
   "dur": 5.664,
   "speechStart": 68.278,
   "speechEnd": 73.016
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "交易记录默认折叠零额转账和陌生代币。",
   "spoken": "交易记录默认折叠零额转账和陌生代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-14.mp3",
   "start": 74.064,
   "dur": 4.032,
   "speechStart": 74.162,
   "speechEnd": 77.245
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "充值只认白名单里的代币合约，假 USDT 不入账。",
   "spoken": "充值只认白名单里的代币合约，假 USDT 不入账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-15.mp3",
   "start": 78.316,
   "dur": 4.896,
   "speechStart": 78.414,
   "speechEnd": 82.39
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "上币前，检查卖出限制、持仓集中度和增发权限。",
   "spoken": "上币前，检查卖出限制、持仓集中度和增发权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-16.mp3",
   "start": 83.432,
   "dur": 5.424,
   "speechStart": 83.53,
   "speechEnd": 88.018
  },
  {
